qarchiver (2.3.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Read .tar.zst / .tzst / .zst archives (read-only through the bundled
    7-Zip).
  * Persist the item-size slider asynchronously (400 ms) instead of writing
    QSettings on every step; restore the default size to 96.
  * Fix the pending "Open With" mode when a continuous preview extraction is
    already running, and only expose that action on Windows.
  * Sort button uses the standard two-arrow icon (centred), the item-size
    slider moved to the bottom-right status bar, and Ctrl+wheel zoom remains.
  * Taller near-square folder icon, generated from an SVG source at 256px.
  * Image thumbnails keep their aspect ratio and are centred instead of being
    stretched into a square.
  * Modern layout uses a 10.5pt font, tighter 128x152 grid cells (icon and
    label fill about 80%), and a darker sidebar for better contrast.
  * Installer defaults to Simplified Chinese on Chinese systems.
  * Installers and portable ZIP stay in a single GitHub Release.

 -- shenmo <shenmo@spark-app.store>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800

qarchiver (2.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Windows Explorer context menu now uses a small in-process shell extension:
    the label includes the selected file name ("添加到 xx.zip"), archive files
    are excluded from the compress commands, and the format submenu is
    generated dynamically.
  * Installer asks whether to associate archive formats (default checked);
    Preferences/Tools gained a cross-platform file-association manager
    (Windows ProgIDs / Linux mimeapps.list + xdg-mime).
  * Shell context-menu compression and extraction run dialog-only: no main
    window is shown; only the options/progress dialogs appear.
  * Windows compression/extraction now reports progress and log lines
    (7-Zip -bsp1, CR/LF progress parsing).
  * Thumbnails keep the original aspect ratio instead of being cropped into a
    square; WebP/TIFF support via the Qt imageformats module.
  * Modern layout: sort-button icon fix, icon-size slider and Ctrl+wheel zoom,
    10pt default font, larger grid items and clearer sidebar contrast.
  * One-click extraction honours the current selection.
  * Windows installer is bilingual (Simplified Chinese / English).
  * Each release contains both installers (Windows setup.exe + Linux .deb)
    and the portable Windows ZIP.

 -- shenmo <shenmo@spark-app.store>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:40:00 +0800

qarchiver (2.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Browse the local file system when no archive is open (Windows and Linux):
    directory navigation, search, grid/list/tree views and context menus.
  * Windows installer (Inno Setup) in addition to the portable ZIP; the
    installer and portable setup script register richer Explorer menus:
    open, one-click extract, "add to <name>.zip" for files/folders, and a
    "Compress to..." submenu (7z, ZIP, tar.gz, tar.xz, tar.bz2, tar).
  * New command line options --compress <format>, --output and
    --compress-dialog used by the Explorer integration.
  * Sort menu (name, size, type, modified; ascending/descending) in the
    context menu and next to the view switcher, with the choice persisted.
  * Windows preview: reuse cached images per file so the system image viewer
    no longer triggers "file in use" sharing violations; include archive
    size/mtime in the preview cache key; accept .jpeg and other image types;
    retry transient Windows file locks during extraction.
  * Prefer Microsoft YaHei UI / Microsoft YaHei on Windows so Chinese text is
    no longer rendered with SimSun (宋体).

 -- shenmo <shenmo@spark-app.store>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0800

