qarchiver (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New 0.1.2 release: modern HaoZip-style interface with a switchable classic
    layout, grid/list/tree archive views, one-click extraction, 7-Zip
    benchmark, Windows x64/ARM64 packaging, more compression formats and
    file-type icons, native file dialogs.
  * Sources refactored into layered static libraries (common, utils, backends,
    core, ui) and ArchiveManager/MainWindow split by responsibility.
  * Icons, theme glyphs and style sheets moved to resources/ at the repository
    root, split into icons/classic, icons/modern, icons/file-types and
    themes/<theme>/{light,dark}; resource paths now equal file paths.
  * Archive suffix handling unified in FormatRegistry; the test suite is
    registered through qarchiver_add_test().
  * Preferences hide options that do not apply to the selected interface
    layout; the classic layout always uses the tree view.
  * Debian packaging (debian/control) and build-dependency tooling.

 -- shenmo <shenmo@spark-app.store>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800
